<worksheet xml:id="o-activity">
<title>M220 Module 9: Orthogonality</title>

<author>
<personnam>Dr. Anastasiia Minenkova</personnam>
</author>

<introduction>

<p>
Name: _______________________
</p>

<p>
Problem Number: _______________________
</p>

</introduction>

<subsection xml:id="learning-outcomesO">
<title>Learning Outcomes</title>
<list>
<dl>
<li><title>O1</title> <p>
  determine if  given map is an inner product,
  </p></li>
  <li><title>O2</title> <p>
    determine whether two vectors from an abstract vector space are orthogonal,
    </p>
    </li>
    <li><title>O3</title> <p>
        use the transpose to find a basis for the orthogonal complement of a given vector space,
       </p>
       </li>
       <li> <title>O4</title> <p>perform Orthogonal Decomposition,</p></li>
       <li><title>O5</title> <p>use Gram-Schmidt Orthogonalization to find an orthogonal basis for a given vector space,</p></li>
       <li><title>O6</title> <p>find an orthonormal basis from an orthogonal basis for a given vector space.</p></li>
</dl>
</list>
</subsection>

<subsection xml:id="oinstructions">

<title>Worksheet Instructions</title>

<ol>
