</li>
</ol>

</subsection>

<subsection xml:id="oassignments">

<title>Assignments</title>
</subsection>
<subsection xml:id="o1">
<dl>
<li>
<title>O1</title>
  <p>
        determine if given maps from column A are inner products in the corresponding
        spaces.
        </p>
        </li>
        <li>
        <title>O2</title>
        <p>
        determine
        whether two vectors from <m>\mathbb{R}^{2\times2}</m> (column B) with the inner
        product given by <m>\langle A,B\rangle=\mathrm{tr}(AB^{\top})</m>
        (<m>\mathrm{tr}(A)</m> is called the trace of <m>A</m> and it is the sum of the
        diagonal entries of <m>A</m>) are orthogonal.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
        <title>O3</title>
        <p>
        Find a basis for the orthogonal complement of the given vector space <m>W</m>.
        </p>
        </li>
        <li>
        <title>O4</title>
        <p>
        perform
        Orthogonal Decomposition of <m>x</m> with respect to <m>W</m>.
        </p>
        </li>
        <li>
        <title>O5-06</title>
        <p>
        use
        Gram-Schmidt Orthogonalization to find an orthonormal basis for the given vector
        space <m>W</m>.
  </p>
</li>
</dl>
</subsection>

<subsection xml:id="sec-otables" class="smalltext">

<table xml:id="o-table">
  <tabular>
    <row header="yes">
      <cell><p>
                #</p></cell>
      <cell><p>
                A <m>(u,v\in\mathbb{R}^{4},\ p,q\in \mathbb{P}_{2})</m>
            </p></cell>
      <cell><p>
                B
            </p></cell>
      <cell><p>
                <m>x</m> and a basis for <m>W</m>
            </p></cell>
    </row>
    <row>
  <cell><m>1</m></cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{aligned}
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = u_1v_1+2u_2v_2+3u_3v_3+4u_4v_4 \\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle=\int_0^1 p(t)q(t)t^2\,dt \\
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = u_1v_1+u_2v_2-u_3v_3-u_4v_4 \\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle = p(0)q(0) \\
&amp; -------------------
\end{aligned}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{bmatrix}1&amp; 1\\0&amp; -1\end{bmatrix},
\quad
\begin{bmatrix}1&amp; -1\\0&amp; 1\end{bmatrix}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
x=\begin{bmatrix}1\\2\\1\\1\end{bmatrix},
\quad
W=\mathrm{span}\!\left\{
\begin{bmatrix}1\\0\\1\\0\end{bmatrix},
\begin{bmatrix}1\\1\\0\\1\end{bmatrix},
\begin{bmatrix}1\\1\\1\\1\end{bmatrix}
\right\}
    </me>
  </cell>
</row>

<row>
  <cell><m>2</m></cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{aligned}
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = u_1v_1+4u_2v_2+4u_3v_3+u_4v_4\\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle=\int_{-1}^1 p(t)q(t)e^t\,dt\\
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = u^\top v^\top\\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle = p(1)q'(1)\\
&amp; -------------------
\end{aligned}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{bmatrix}2&amp; 0\\0&amp; -1\end{bmatrix},
\quad
\begin{bmatrix}0&amp; 1\\1&amp; 0\end{bmatrix}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
x=\begin{bmatrix}0\\1\\2\\1\end{bmatrix},
\quad
W=\mathrm{span}\!\left\{
\begin{bmatrix}1\\0\\1\\1\end{bmatrix},
\begin{bmatrix}0\\1\\1\\0\end{bmatrix},
\begin{bmatrix}1\\1\\0\\0\end{bmatrix}
\right\}
    </me>
  </cell>
</row>

<row>
  <cell><m>3</m></cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{aligned}
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = 2u_1v_1+u_2v_2+u_3v_3+2u_4v_4\\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle = \int_0^1 p(t)q(t)\,dt + p(0)q(0)\\
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = u_1v_1\\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle = p(0)\\
&amp; -------------------
\end{aligned}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{bmatrix}1&amp; 2\\-1&amp; 0\end{bmatrix},
\quad
\begin{bmatrix}2&amp; -1\\1&amp; 2\end{bmatrix}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
x=\begin{bmatrix}2\\1\\0\\1\end{bmatrix},
\quad
W=\mathrm{span}\!\left\{
\begin{bmatrix}1\\0\\0\\1\end{bmatrix},
\begin{bmatrix}0\\1\\1\\0\end{bmatrix},
\begin{bmatrix}1\\1\\0\\0\end{bmatrix}
\right\}
    </me>
  </cell>
</row>

<row>
  <cell><m>4</m></cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{aligned}
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = u_1v_1+4u_2v_2+9u_3v_3+16u_4v_4\\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle = p(0)q(0)+p'(0)q'(0)\\
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = u^\top v + 1\\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle = p(0)q(1)\\
&amp; -------------------
\end{aligned}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{bmatrix}2&amp; 1\\1&amp; 0\end{bmatrix},
\quad
\begin{bmatrix}0&amp; 1\\-1&amp; 2\end{bmatrix}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
x=\begin{bmatrix}1\\0\\2\\1\end{bmatrix},
\quad
W=\mathrm{span}\!\left\{
\begin{bmatrix}1\\1\\1\\0\end{bmatrix},
\begin{bmatrix}0\\1\\0\\1\end{bmatrix},
\begin{bmatrix}1\\0\\1\\1\end{bmatrix}
\right\}
    </me>
  </cell>
</row>

<row>
  <cell><m>5</m></cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{aligned}
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = 3u_1v_1+u_2v_2+u_3v_3+u_4v_4\\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle = \int_0^1 p(t)q(t)e^{-t}\,dt\\
&amp; \langle u,v\rangle = 0\\
&amp; \langle p,q\rangle = p(0)^2\\
&amp; -------------------
\end{aligned}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
\begin{bmatrix}3&amp; -1\\2&amp; 0\end{bmatrix},
\quad
\begin{bmatrix}1&amp; 3\\0&amp; -2\end{bmatrix}
    </me>
  </cell>
  <cell>
    <me>
x=\begin{bmatrix}2\\1\\0\\1\end{bmatrix},
\quad
W=\mathrm{span}\!\left\{
